course: dictionary
lesson: 12718
title: Doubler: something that doubles
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: A doubler is a thing, or a person, that doubles an amount or size. To double means to make something two times as big. The ending -er often means a thing that does a job, so a doubler is the thing that does the doubling.
explain: «Our number machine is a doubler: put in 4 and it gives out 8.» The word doubles tells you what the machine does. Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence: 4 times 2 is 8, so it still makes sense.
explain: In games and sport, a doubler is a move or score that counts twice. «Landing on the red square was a doubler, so Maya got 20 points instead of 10.» The word points shows that the score changed, and it went up to twice as much.
fact: Doubler comes from the word double, which means two times as much.
fact: In maths, a doubler is a machine or rule that doubles numbers.
fact: «The quiz had one doubler question, worth twice the points.» Here a doubler question is worth double.
fact: In games and sport, a doubler is a move or score that counts twice.
fact: In horse racing betting, a doubler is usually called a «double»: you only win if both races win.
exercise: «The number doubler turned 5 into 10.» What is a doubler? | A machine that makes numbers disappear | A rule for adding one more | *A machine or rule that doubles a number | A number that is cut in half
exercise: «Scoring on the red square was a doubler, so Maya got 20 points.» What does doubler mean here? | A point that is taken away | A square with no points at all | A player who runs away from the game | *A move that counts twice
exercise: «The quiz had one doubler question, worth twice the points.» What does doubler question mean? | *A question worth twice the points | A question that is much shorter than the others | A question you are allowed to skip | A question that is worth no points
test: What is the word for a square on a board game that counts your score twice? | missing | *doubler | halver | ticker
test: Which sentence uses doubler correctly? | «The rain doubler was closed.» | *«The doubler turned 3 into 6.» | «She doubler the cake.» | «The doubler is a wet grey day.»
exam: In horse racing betting, what is a doubler? | A bet on the weather | A bet on one race only | A bet with no winner at all | *A bet on two races, where you only win if both win, usually called a double
